   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Ornamental Pools Kansei</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Ornamental Pools Kansei\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original images: eight conceptual design images of an ornamental pool on a lawn in front of the same apartment blocks, made with 3D modelling and image editing software from the paper's Taguchi L8 orthogonal array of five two-level design factors: depth (shallow, deep), interior surface colour (dark, light), surface planting (bare, vegetated), form (natural, geometric) and motion (still, dynamic fountains). Participants say whether they are a landscape design student or faculty member, then see the eight pools one at a time and rate each on the paper's six Kansei word pairs on a 7-point semantic differential scale: stress inducing - calming, mentally fatiguing - mentally restorative, confusing - legible, boring - captivating, aesthetically displeasing - aesthetically pleasing, unsatisfying - satisfying (1 = left word, 7 = right word, so higher is more positive, as in the paper). Rebuilt from Karaca & Perçin (2026), Integrating Kansei Engineering into Sustainable Landscape Design: An Empirical Study on Ornamental Pools, Sustainability 18(14): 6954, with the images cropped from its Figure 1 (captions trimmed) and the word pairs, factors and design matrix from its Tables 1-3 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: exp1-exp8 as numbered in Table 3; answers are in kansei, keyed by image id; the factor levels of each pool are stored in the page's original-study block. Analysis as in the paper: mean score of each pool on each word pair, Taguchi signal-to-noise ratios (larger is better) to find the best level of each factor for each word, and ANOVA of the factors' contributions; the paper (91 participants: 71 third- and fourth-year landscape design students and 20 landscape design faculty members) found surface planting the dominant factor for captivating and legible, motion the key factor for mental restoration, and a shallow, light-coloured, vegetated, natural-form pool with dynamic water as the best overall configuration. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper briefed participants on the study and gave definitions of each word, which it does not print, so none are given here; (2) the paper ran the survey with three groups at different times, varying the order of the pools between groups; here the order is randomized for each participant; (3) the background question and the instruction text are ours, and anyone can take part, while the paper required training in landscape design; (4) the images are the figure copies (about 870 px wide).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"pools\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"background\",\n      \"title\": \"Which describes you best?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"student3\",\n        \"text\": \"Landscape design student, 3rd year\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"student4\",\n        \"text\": \"Landscape design student, 4th year\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"student_other\",\n        \"text\": \"Landscape design student, other year\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"faculty\",\n        \"text\": \"Landscape design faculty member\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"None of these\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"pools\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"kansei\",\n      \"title\": \"How does this ornamental pool feel to you?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rows\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"k01\",\n        \"text\": \"Stress inducing - Calming\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"k02\",\n        \"text\": \"Mentally fatiguing - Mentally restorative\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"k03\",\n        \"text\": \"Confusing - Legible\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"k04\",\n        \"text\": \"Boring - Captivating\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"k05\",\n        \"text\": \"Aesthetically displeasing - Aesthetically pleasing\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"k06\",\n        \"text\": \"Unsatisfying - Satisfying\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"text\": \"6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 7,\n        \"text\": \"7\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"7-point semantic differential, 1 = left word, 7 = right word. Keyed by image id.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"pool-original\">{\"source\": \"Karaca & Perçin (2026) Sustainability 18: 6954\", \"n\": 91, \"pairs\": {\"k01\": [\"Stress inducing\", \"Calming\"], \"k02\": [\"Mentally fatiguing\", \"Mentally restorative\"], \"k03\": [\"Confusing\", \"Legible\"], \"k04\": [\"Boring\", \"Captivating\"], \"k05\": [\"Aesthetically displeasing\", \"Aesthetically pleasing\"], \"k06\": [\"Unsatisfying\", \"Satisfying\"]}, \"images\": [\"exp1\", \"exp2\", \"exp3\", \"exp4\", \"exp5\", \"exp6\", \"exp7\", \"exp8\"], \"design\": {\"exp1\": {\"depth\": \"shallow\", \"colour\": \"dark coloured\", \"planting\": \"bare\", \"form\": \"natural\", \"motion\": \"still\"}, \"exp2\": {\"depth\": \"shallow\", \"colour\": \"dark coloured\", \"planting\": \"bare\", \"form\": \"geometric\", \"motion\": \"dynamic\"}, \"exp3\": {\"depth\": \"shallow\", \"colour\": \"light coloured\", \"planting\": \"vegetated\", \"form\": \"natural\", \"motion\": \"still\"}, \"exp4\": {\"depth\": \"shallow\", \"colour\": \"light coloured\", \"planting\": \"vegetated\", \"form\": \"geometric\", \"motion\": \"dynamic\"}, \"exp5\": {\"depth\": \"deep\", \"colour\": \"dark coloured\", \"planting\": \"vegetated\", \"form\": \"natural\", \"motion\": \"dynamic\"}, \"exp6\": {\"depth\": \"deep\", \"colour\": \"dark coloured\", \"planting\": \"vegetated\", \"form\": \"geometric\", \"motion\": \"still\"}, \"exp7\": {\"depth\": \"deep\", \"colour\": \"light coloured\", \"planting\": \"bare\", \"form\": \"natural\", \"motion\": \"dynamic\"}, \"exp8\": {\"depth\": \"deep\", \"colour\": \"light coloured\", \"planting\": \"bare\", \"form\": \"geometric\", \"motion\": \"still\"}}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#edf2f4;--card:#fff;--ink:#16212a;--muted:#55636e;--accent:#1f6f8b;--line:#d2dde3;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#d8ecf3}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 4px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.prompt{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;text-align:center}\n.scene{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--bg);padding-bottom:6px}\n.scene img{max-width:100%;max-height:42vh;width:auto;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px}\n@media (max-height:700px),(max-width:600px){.scene{position:static}}\n.it{padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.it .st{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:.96rem}\n.it .o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}\n.it label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.25}\n.it label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.it label input{display:none}.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}@media (max-width:480px){.it .o{gap:3px}.it label{padding:9px 0;font-size:.86rem}}\n.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}\n.it.miss .o,.q.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Images and word pairs: Karaca &amp; Perçin (2026), Sustainability 18(14): 6954, Figure 1 and Tables 1–3 (doi:10.3390/su18146954, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='ornamental-pools-kansei:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('pool-original').textContent), IDS=ORIG.images;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(IDS),k:0};}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Ornamental pools</h1><p>You will see eight design images of an ornamental pool, one at a time. For each pool, choose a point between two opposite words that shows how the pool feels to you. It takes about 8 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\" data-q=\"background\"><b>'+esc(Q.background.title)+'</b>'+(Q.background.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"background\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var g=app.querySelector('input[name=background]:checked');if(!g)return err('Please choose one answer.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('background',g.value)],this,function(){st.step='room';st.k=0;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function room(){\n    if(st.k>=st.order.length){st.step='done';save();return route();}\n    var id=st.order[st.k],f=files[id],q=Q.kansei;\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Pool '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"scene\"><img alt=\"Design image of an ornamental pool\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><h2>'+esc(q.title)+'</h2>'+(q.rows||[]).map(function(r){var nm='c__'+r.value;\n      var pr=ORIG.pairs[r.value]||['',''];return '<div class=\"it\" data-n=\"'+nm+'\"><div class=\"o\">'+[1,2,3,4,5,6,7].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+nm+'\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"an\" style=\"font-size:.86rem;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600\"><span>'+esc(pr[0])+'</span><span style=\"text-align:right\">'+esc(pr[1])+'</span></div></div>';}).join('')+'</div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.k<st.order.length-1?'Next picture':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var a={},miss=[];(q.rows||[]).forEach(function(r){var nm='c__'+r.value,x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+nm+'\"]:checked');if(x)a[r.value]=Number(x.value);else miss.push(app.querySelector('.it[data-n=\"'+nm+'\"]'));});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please answer every pair.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('kansei',a,{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.k++;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  app.addEventListener('change',function(e){var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.it');if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.it.miss'))err('');}});\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='room')return room();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','background','kansei'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('pools')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"pools\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
